# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): Dark-Bright as the sound's character over the demo progression
# (the progression page, a step each 3.5 s): -100, 0, 50, 100, then gliding back to 0. Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
wait 1500
wav dark-character.wav
set 86 -100
tapkey 0
wait 3500
set 86 0
tapkey 0
wait 3500
set 86 50
tapkey 0
wait 3500
set 86 100
tapkey 0
wait 3500
shot bright.png
set 86 0
tapkey 0
wait 3500
wavstop
